586560343,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VxpFX","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-27T15:53:54Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T15:53:54Z","body":"- I think this was actually caused by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113070.\r\n\r\nMoving the `p_dock->show()` in `open_dock` to after it is already in the TabContainer caused `TabContainer::_on_tab_visibility_changed` to be called which automatically sets the changing tab to be the one being shown. This didn't happen before since it was visible before adding to the TabContainer, so the current tab was left at 0.\r\nSo `open_dock`'s `p_set_current` is currently not being respected.\r\n\r\nI think `p_dock->show()` can just be removed, since the TabContainer handles the visibility.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3586560343/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/co